<title>PERU: Peru says Ecuador soldiers arrested on border.</title>
<headline>Peru says Ecuador soldiers arrested on border.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru said on Wednesday it had arrested six Ecuadorean soldiers who carried arms and mines across a disputed border zone over which the two countries went to war in 1995.</p>
<p>&quot;Yesterday, six Ecuadorean soldiers were detained, who had entered seven kilometres (4.5 miles) inside our border,&quot; Congress President Victor Joy Way told reporters in Lima.</p>
